project/design-kit-splitpanel-drag-persist: anentrypoint-design SplitPanel stored resize as inline pane style; a parent applyDiff re-render reconciled it back to initial, resetting editor split positions on every entity-select. Fix: persist draggedSize in closure + reapply from the pane ref after each diff (editor-primitives.js SplitPanel). Published 0.0.175. General rule: imperative DOM state set on a diffed vnode must be reapplied via ref, not stored only as inline style.